# 16. LOGIN NOTIFICATION RATE LIMITING

Do not create a system that sends unlimited emails on repeated attacks.

Use appropriate rate limiting/debouncing.

For example:

```text
Repeated failed attempts
        ↓
Audit every attempt
        ↓
Email only when threshold/risk condition is met
```

If the existing implementation already has a notification policy, preserve it.

